    <rdfs:comment>Disposal instruction of End-of-Life Disposal with ID Rmhp8V</rdfs:comment>
    <ns4:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Separate steel panels, locks, and plastic components for recycling. - Steel frame and panels: recycle as ferrous metal. - Lock systems: dismantle and sort metal and plastic parts. - Plastic accessories: recycle according to local regulations. Dispose of non-recyclable residues according to municipal waste management procedures.</ns4:description>
